<title>NORWAY: Norway's Sept PPI rose 2.8 percent year/year.</title>
<headline>Norway's Sept PPI rose 2.8 percent year/year.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Norway issued the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> NORWAY PRODUCER PRICES    SEPT 1996  AUG 1996  SEPT 1995</p>
<p> Month-on-month change	 +1.3	+0.1	+0.5</p>
<p> Year-on-year change	   +2.8	+1.9	+2.8</p>
<p> Index (base 1981)	    160.5     158.5     156.2</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
